{"id": "q0494", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Imagine an app that uses voice recognition to help people with disabilities communicate more easily. It could trans late their speech into text in real time, allowing them to participate in conversations, write messages, or even control devices using just their voice.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0501", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are a few different things that companies can do. They could switch to renewable energy sources like solar or wind power for their operations. They could also invest in energy efficient technology and processes, such as LED lighting or smart building systems. Another option is to reduce waste by implementing recycling programs or using sustainable materials in production. Some companies have even started to offset their carbon footprint by investing in re forestation projects or purchasing carbon credits from other companies. It' s important for businesses to take action on climate change because it not only helps the environment but can also lead to cost savings and improved reputation among customers who value sustainability efforts.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
